AutoHDR-VK
==========

Tone-curve evaluation, preset curves, and core SDR→HDR color processing
(black point, gamut expansion helpers) are adapted from PlasmaAutoHDR:

  https://github.com/LewisTansley/PlasmaAutoHDR

ICtCp conversion (Dolby LMS, BT.2100 LMS_PQ↔ICtCp matrices, PQ EOTF)
follows ITU-R BT.2100 and published Dolby ICtCp LMS coefficients. The
I-only luminance application with Ct/Cp preserved follows the same
approach used by Plasma/KWin color management for hue-stable tonemapping;
this repository does not copy KWin source.

The Vulkan layer scaffolding, present-time pipeline, TOML configuration,
and packaging in this repository are original to AutoHDR-VK.
